    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Consent.** Only consented properties are probed: a property appears here only if it is verified (`verified_at` set), active and not deleted. Unverified properties are absent, not throttled.\n\n**Where probes run.** Probes are outbound HTTP GETs made from **sumopod** (the hub's blackbox-exporter), never from gda-aicenter.\n\n**Internal sites.** Our own sites belong to the internal sentinel client (`clients.is_internal`) and carry the label `internal=\"true\"`. They are hidden by default (the Internal variable defaults to `false`); pick `true` or `All` to see them. Client-facing views should keep the default."
      }
    }
